---
---
<section class="section" id="quickstart">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-eyebrow" data-i18n="quickstart.eyebrow">配置指南</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="quickstart.title">如何配合 CLIProxyAPI 使用</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle" data-i18n="quickstart.subtitle">只需在 CLIProxyAPI 中开启管理密钥，并在 ClipBar 偏好设置中完成填报即可。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="quickstart.step1.title">1. 开启 CLIProxyAPI 管理接口</h3>
        <p data-i18n="quickstart.step1.desc">在你的 <code>config.yaml</code> 配置文件中开启 <code>remote-management</code> 并设置访问密钥：</p>
        <div class="brew-action-pill" style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.8rem;">
          <code>remote-management.secret-key: "your-key"</code>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="quickstart.step2.title">2. 在 ClipBar 中填入密钥</h3>
        <p data-i18n="quickstart.step2.desc">启动 ClipBar，右键菜单栏图标打开<b>偏好设置</b>，填入本地管理地址（默认 <code>http://127.0.0.1:8317</code>）和管理密钥。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="quickstart.step3.title">3. 状态栏随时掌握额度</h3>
        <p data-i18n="quickstart.step3.desc">菜单栏将实时显示最低/加权剩余额度百分比，点击即可展开查看每个账号的 5h/7d 配额进度条与重置倒计时。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
